ted 03.02.2016. The Plaintiff-Appellant-Respondent (hereinafter referred to as the “Respondent”) instituted the initial action before the District Court of Batticaloa by Plaint dated 08.11.2011 against the Defendant-Respondent-Appellant (hereinafter referred to as the “Appellant”) after which an amended plaint was filed on 30.05.2012 seeking a declaration that the Respondent is the owner of the land described in the schedule B to the Plaint, an order to eject the Defendants from the subject land

